## Pure module changes — `js/common/checkRunZombies.js`

Add exports (additive):
1. `DEFAULT_PLACEHOLDER_MINUTES = 3`
2. `placeholders(checkRuns, nowMs, opts)` → array of `{name, runId: null, reason: 'placeholder', startedAtMs}` for pending + link-less + older than placeholderMinutes. Unparseable/fresh → not placeholders (fail safe).
3. `hasPlaceholderZombies(zombies)` → true if any zombie has runId === null (the placeholder shape among classify() zombies — 'stale-no-runner').
4. Marker/cap helpers (per-PR, windowed — the cap must span head moves):
   - `PLACEHOLDER_MARKER_RE` — parse `🔁 placeholder reset N/M at <iso>` lines.
   - `placeholderMarks(bodies)` → `{count, lastAtMs}` — max N and newest timestamp across all marker lines (per PR, NOT per head).
   - `placeholderMarkerLine(count, cap, atIso)`
   - `placeholderCapOf(jobParams)` — default 3 (ticket: "Retry cap per PR per 2h"; 3 resets per 2h default seems sane).
   - `placeholderWindowMsOf(jobParams)` — default 2h.
