## Pure module changes — `js/common/checkRunZombies.js`

Add exports (additive):
1. `DEFAULT_PLACEHOLDER_MINUTES = 3`
2. `placeholders(checkRuns, nowMs, opts)` → array of `{name, runId: null, reason: 'placeholder', startedAtMs}` for pending + link-less + older than placeholderMinutes. Unparseable/fresh → not placeholders (fail safe).
3. `hasPlaceholderZombies(zombies)` → true if any zombie has runId === null (the placeholder shape among classify() zombies — 'stale-no-runner').
